<h1>Privacy Policy for Birthday Reminder</h1>
<p><strong>Last updated: September 8, 2026</strong></p>

<p>This Privacy Policy describes how the Birthday Reminder app ("the App", "we", "us") handles information when you use our application.</p>

<h2>Information We Collect</h2>

<h3>Information You Provide</h3>
<p>The App allows you to store the following information locally on your device:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Names and dates of birth of people you choose to add</li>
  <li>Optional photos you attach to entries</li>
  <li>Custom categories, colors, and other personalization settings you create</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>This information is stored locally on your device and is not transmitted to us or to any server we control.</strong> We do not collect, view, or have access to this data.</p>

<h3>Automatically Collected Information (via Advertising)</h3>
<p>The App displays advertisements provided by Google AdMob. To serve ads, Google AdMob and its partners may collect and process:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Advertising identifiers (such as the Android Advertising ID)</li>
  <li>Device information (device type, operating system version)</li>
  <li>General location information (derived from IP address, not precise GPS location)</li>
  <li>Ad interaction data (impressions, clicks)</li>
</ul>
<p>This data is collected and processed by Google in accordance with <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank">Google's Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank">Google's Partner Policy</a>.</p>
<p>Where required by law (including the EU General Data Protection Regulation), the App requests your consent before showing personalized ads, using Google's User Messaging Platform (UMP). You can manage or withdraw your consent at any time through the consent dialog shown in the App.</p>

<h2>How We Use Information</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Data you enter (names, dates, photos, preferences) is used solely to provide the App's core functionality: displaying your saved entries and sending you birthday reminder notifications. This processing happens entirely on your device.</li>
  <li>Advertising data is used by Google AdMob to serve and measure advertisements within the App, as described above.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Data Storage and Security</h2>
<p>All personal data you enter into the App (names, dates, photos, categories) is stored locally on your device using secure local storage. This data:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Is never transmitted to us</li>
  <li>Is not backed up to any server we control</li>
  <li>Remains on your device unless you back it up yourself or uninstall the App (which deletes it)</li>
</ul>
<p>If you use your device's own backup features (e.g., Google's Android backup service), your data may be included in those backups according to your device manufacturer's and Google's own policies, which are outside our control.</p>

<h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
<p>The App uses the following third-party service:</p>
<p><strong>Google AdMob</strong> &mdash; for displaying advertisements. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank">Google's Privacy Policy</a> for details on how Google handles data.</p>
<p>We do not use any other third-party analytics, crash reporting, or data collection services at this time.</p>

<h2>Notifications</h2>
<p>The App uses your device's local notification system to remind you of upcoming birthdays. These notifications are scheduled and delivered entirely on your device and do not involve any external server or push notification service.</p>

<h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
<p>The App is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. Since all personal data is stored locally on the user's own device and never transmitted to us, we have no visibility into who uses the App.</p>

<h2>Your Rights</h2>
<p>Since your personal data (names, birthdates, photos) is stored only on your device and never sent to us, you have full control over it at all times:</p>
<ul>
  <li>You can view, edit, or delete any entry directly within the App</li>
  <li>You can delete all data by uninstalling the App</li>
  <li>For questions about data collected by Google AdMob, please refer to <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank">Google's Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank">Google's Ads Settings</a></li>
</ul>

<h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
<p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted at this same URL with an updated "Last updated" date.</p>

<h2>Contact Us</h2>
<p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, you can contact us at: <strong>[topirceanilie90@gmail.com]</strong></p>

